new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4e24f2f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/hosting/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Windows hosting
+
+Build: node hosting/build.cjs PUBLIC_BUILD_SETTINGS_JSON EMPTY_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY
+
+The build settings JSON may contain only NEXT_PUBLIC_ values. Use {} if none are required. Never pass production secrets to the build.
+
+Start a packaged release with SONGDEE_CONFIG pointing to its protected runtime JSON, then run node hosting/launch.cjs. Runtime configuration remains outside Git and the release.
+
+The launcher opts into SONGDEE_WINDOWS_HOSTING=1 and binds to loopback. Existing cloud deployments leave that flag unset. Database migrations are never part of this build.
+
+Deployment is not enabled by adding these files. The Windows controller, service configuration, initial baseline revision, and rollback checks must be installed and validated separately.
